From 60710b1864dc2e3c62c479fd07b5cbb2ffda22b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Jul 2025 13:41:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 009/190] drm: xlnx: mmi-dc: Introduce DC plane interface

commit 25fee59a8a4876f9c3bf99f80c809e67b6e2f1ee from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Introduce abstract MMI DC plane interface. Subclass DC overlay and primary
planes. Move the DC-to-plane interface into a plane specific header. Hide
video plane specific data structures and defines from the common DC header
file. Simplify DC plane related data structures.

This refactoring is a preparation for extending MMI DC functionality by
implementing the cursor, adding advanced plane composition features, and
introducing the live video input. This new functionality will require the
addition of new plane types. These new planes will significantly differ
both structurally and behaviorally.

